    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Munhū na lūgoye lwa kūpimīla",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūlola hangī ī gīkī, nūbona munhū ū kū būtongi bone; ū mu nkono gwakwe walī adimīīlile lūgoye lwa kūpimīla! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūmūja, “Ūlīja halī?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūnishokeja, “Nalīja kūgūpima ū nzengo gwa Yelusalemu, nagūbone ūmo gūlī ū būgalī galī nū būlīhu waago.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū malaika ūyo waniwīlaga mihayo wīnga; ūnileka, kwimanīla wiza malaika ūngī alīmanhya nang'hwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūshika ūng'wīla, “Peelaga ūkang'wīle ū nsūmba ng'wenūyo gīkī, ‘Ū nzengo gwa Yelusalemu gūtūbiza na ndugu hangī, kūlwa nguno ya wingī wa banhū, nī mitugo ījo jikūbiza moi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nene ng'wenekīlī nakūbiza ndugu ya moto ya kūgūpīndya,’ alīhaya SEEBA, ‘hama nakūbiza ikūjo lyaago.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bing'we! Bing'we! Peelagi ng'wīnge ū kū sī ya sukuma.” Alīhaya SEEBA, “Nguno ū nene hū namusalang'hanya hose pye ū mu masī ayo galī ha sīlīlī y'igūlū,” alīhaya SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bebe Sayuni, Peelaga! Bebe ūyo ūkwikalaga Babuloni, ipījage!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū SEEBA wa Būdūla bose ūyo waninhile ikūjo ūnitūma kūja kū mahanga ayo gaalī gaamutaaja sabo jing'we, alīhaya gīkī, “Ūyo ūmukuumya a bing'we wakuumyaga mboni ya liso lyane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Liso lyane:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shihebulania, liso lyakwe.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nakūbanungīja nkono, a basese babo kūbataaja ī sabo jabo. A henaho hū mukūdeeba gīkī ū SEEBA wa Būdūla bose hū ng'wene wanitūmile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bebe Sayuni, tūlaga lūpūndū ūyege. Nguno nakwiza, nize nikale hamò ning'we.” Alīhaya SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Banhū ba mahanga mingī bakwisangīja kūlī SEEBA ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo, nabo bakūbiza banhū bane. Nakwikala hamò ning'we, hūna mukūdeeba gīkī ū SEEBA wa Būdūla bose wanitūmile ū kū bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī Yuda, īyo īlī ngabo gwakwe ū mu sī neela, īkūbiza wingīji bo ng'wa SEEBA, hūna akwīsola hangī ī Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we banhū bose lembeelagi ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, nguno izile kūfuma ū kū wikalo bokwe wela.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.2.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
